{"id":"a891026ecead4cd3","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-length-bound.md","title":"Proof Length Bound","display":"df-proof-length-bound — Proof Length Bound","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-length-bound","aliases":["72-df-proof-length-bound"],"display":"df-proof-length-bound — Proof Length Bound","depends_on":[],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4; print36–42; PDF48–54","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-length-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-length-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-length-bound — Proof Length Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4; print36–42; PDF48–54"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是固定演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span> 是其中合法输入证明的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P_0\">\\(\\mathsf P_0\\)</span> 是合法无切输出证明的集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\mathsf P\\cup\\mathsf P_0\\to Q\">\\(c:\\mathsf P\\cup\\mathsf P_0\\to Q\\)</span> 为结论函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathsf P\\cup\\mathsf P_0\\to\\omega\">\\(\\mu:\\mathsf P\\cup\\mathsf P_0\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为同一种长度度量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathsf P\\to\\omega\">\\(d:\\mathsf P\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为切度量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\">\\(B:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P,\\mathsf P_0,c,\\mu,d\">\\(\\mathsf P,\\mathsf P_0,c,\\mu,d\\)</span> 是此谓词的显式参数；使用具体 CutDeg 或 size 时必须给出这些参数的实例化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CutElimBound}(\\mathsf P,\\mathsf P_0,c,\\mu,d,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathsf P\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathsf P_0\\ \\bigl(c(\\pi&#39;)=c(\\pi)\\land\\mu(\\pi&#39;)\\le B(\\mu(\\pi),d(\\pi))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CutElimBound}(\\mathsf P,\\mathsf P_0,c,\\mu,d,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathsf P\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathsf P_0\\ \\bigl(c(\\pi&#39;)=c(\\pi)\\land\\mu(\\pi&#39;)\\le B(\\mu(\\pi),d(\\pi))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是第 I 章 §2.4 定量切消讨论（印刷 pp.36–42 / PDF pp.48–54）的参数化定义。原式的无界量词错误地覆盖了任意集合；现在只覆盖合法证明，并把节点数、编码长度等不同度量分开。该定义本身不主张任意演算都有这样的界，也不主张统一单指数界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P_0","display":false},{"tex":"c:\\mathsf P\\cup\\mathsf P_0\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:\\mathsf P\\cup\\mathsf P_0\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathsf P\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B:\\omega^2\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P,\\mathsf P_0,c,\\mu,d","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CutElimBound}(\\mathsf P,\\mathsf P_0,c,\\mu,d,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathsf P\\ \\exists\\pi'\\in\\mathsf P_0\\ \\bigl(c(\\pi')=c(\\pi)\\land\\mu(\\pi')\\le B(\\mu(\\pi),d(\\pi))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-length-bound|df-proof-length-bound — Proof Length Bound]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-length-bound|df-proof-length-bound — Proof Length Bound]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-length-bound|72-df-proof-length-bound]]"}],"outgoing":[]}